{"term": {"label": "信", "variants": []}, "source": {"id": "7B", "url": "https://ctext.org/mengzi/jin-xin-ii", "title": "盡心下", "description": "孟子曰：「不仁哉，梁惠王也！仁者以其所愛及其所不愛，不仁者以其所不愛及其所愛。」\n公孫丑問曰：「何謂也？」\n「梁惠王以土地之故，糜爛其民而戰之，大敗，將復之，恐不能勝，故驅其所愛子弟以殉之，是之謂以其所不愛及其所愛也。」\n孟子曰：「《春秋》無義戰。彼善於此，則有之矣。征者上伐下也，敵國不相征也。」\n孟子曰：「盡信《書》", "occurrences": 8, "data": null}, "network": {"directed": false, "multigraph": false, "graph": {}, "nodes": [{"form": "亂", "id": "亂"}, {"form": "人", "id": "人"}, {"form": "仁", "id": "仁"}, {"form": "似", "id": "似"}, {"form": "信", "id": "信"}, {"form": "去", "id": "去"}, {"form": "名", "id": "名"}, {"form": "國", "id": "國"}, {"form": "恐", "id": "恐"}, {"form": "惡", "id": "惡"}, {"form": "愛", "id": "愛"}, {"form": "敵", "id": "敵"}, {"form": "禮", "id": "禮"}, {"form": "絜", "id": "絜"}, {"form": "義", "id": "義"}, {"form": "行", "id": "行"}], "edges": [{"weight": 2.1832383353614797, "source": "亂", "target": "禮"}, {"weight": 1.9600947840472698, "source": "亂", "target": "義"}, {"weight": 2.8763855159214247, "source": "亂", "target": "恐"}, {"weight": 1.490091154801534, "source": "亂", "target": "信"}, {"weight": 2.4709204078132605, "source": "似", "target": "信"}, {"weight": 3.164067588373206, "source": "似", "target": "絜"}, {"weight": 2.247776856499051, "source": "似", "target": "行"}, {"weight": 2.4709204078132605, "source": "似", "target": "惡"}, {"weight": 2.653241964607215, "source": "絜", "target": "行"}, {"weight": 1.6236225474260568, "source": "名", "target": "人"}, {"weight": 3.0099169085459474, "source": "名", "target": "國"}, {"weight": 1.2669476034873244, "source": "信", "target": "仁"}, {"weight": 1.6236225474260568, "source": "信", "target": "國"}, {"weight": 0.23732818630616614, "source": "信", "target": "人"}, {"weight": 1.777773227253315, "source": "信", "target": "恐"}, {"weight": 2.653241964607215, "source": "義", "target": "禮"}, {"weight": 1.5546296759391054, "source": "義", "target": "恐"}, {"weight": 2.6044518004377832, "source": "去", "target": "國"}, {"weight": 2.247776856499051, "source": "仁", 